..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : BROWSER.BSTART.BN
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Funktion       : Startet den Browser mit der URL.
.. Functionality  : Starts Browser using the URL.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue BOTHOPT ? M|newwindow & M|browsefilesystem
.continue NEWWIN  ? M|newwindow
.continue FILESYS ? M|browsefilesystem
..
.. No options
.browser 'M|url'
.continue END
..
!BOTHOPT: Set both options
.browser -new -file 'M|url'
.continue END
..
!NEWWIN: Set new window option
.browser -new 'M|url'
.continue END
..
!FILESYS: Set browse filesystem option
.browser -file 'M|url'
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
